<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney raises bank targets.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney raises bank targets.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised the 12-18 month target on BankAmerica Corp to $115 per share from $100, analyst Henry Dickson's office said</p>
<p>-- The analyst raised the target on Chase Manhattan Corp target to $115 per share from $100</p>
<p>-- The analyst raised the target on NationBank Corp to  $125 per share from $105</p>
</text>
